  "title": "Avient Announces Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "CLEVELAND, May 15, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- The Board of Directors of Avient Corporation (NYSE: AVNT), an innovator of materials solutions, has declared a quarterly cash dividend of twenty-seven and a half cents ($0.275) per share on the common stock outstanding, to be paid on July 15, 2026, to stockholders of record on June 18, 2026",
